As of right now the way to get the most automated: 
1. Click on the info icon for the top alert. 
2. Go to the JSON tab
3. Ctrl + a > ctrl + c
4. paste into powershell script
Note: The way the link works is it takes your current tab and since being on JSON makes the link longer it autocuts the link at the first question mark

